### Cost

| Action            | Gas Cost   | USD Cost (Arc) |
| ----------------- | ---------- | -------------- |
| register()        | ~0.006 USDC | ~$0.006        |
| giveFeedback()    | ~0.006 USDC | ~$0.006        |
| validationRequest | ~0.006 USDC | ~$0.006        |

**Total per agent lifecycle:** ~$0.02 USDC

### Why This Is Better

| Aspect            | Custom Contract    | Official ERC-8004   |
| ----------------- | ------------------ | ------------------- |
| **Deploy needed**     | Yes (time + cost)  | No — already on Arc |
| **Standard**          | Custom             | Official EIP-8004   |
| **Portable**          | Trivo-locked       | Works everywhere    |
| **Judges' reaction**  | "Is this standard?" | "Yes, ERC-8004!"   |
| **Integration time**  | 1-2 hours          | 30 minutes          |
| **Maintenance**       | We maintain        | Community maintains |
| **Audit**             | Self-audited       | Official audits     |

