## What Makes Trivo Unique vs Moss

| Feature                | Moss             | Trivo                                    |
| ---------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| **Agent Identity**         | ❌ None          | ✅ ERC-8004 on Arc (official standard)   |
| **On-chain Reputation**    | ❌ Off-chain     | ✅ ReputationRegistry feedback           |
| **Copy Trading**           | ❌ None          | ✅ On-chain attribution + fees           |
| **AI Tool Calling**        | ✅ Basic         | ✅ ASI:One + Heurist ReAct loop          |
| **Semantic Memory**        | ❌ None          | ✅ Heurist embeddings                    |
| **Risk Management**        | ❌ Unknown       | ✅ Full risk gates + circuit breaker     |
| **Transparent Reasoning**  | ❌ Unknown       | ✅ Every decision logged                 |
| **X Signal**               | ✅ Yes           | ✅ get_sentiment tool                    |
| **Multi-chain**            | ✅ Yes           | ❌ Arc only (focused)                    |
| **Chrome Extension**       | ✅ Yes           | ❌ No                                    |

**Trivo's moat:** On-chain identity (ERC-8004) + Copy trading + Transparent reasoning + Multi-model AI

